<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ka Denbi, Buk 1</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ka Denbi, Buk 1</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ka Denbi, Buk 1</para>
  <para style="mt">Ka Denbi, Buk 1</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Solomon's temple" file="FM 117 Solomon Dedicates the Temple_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Devit wam Solomon Yawe yugumo kei tenabedi taragl ake kun ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Ana Devit nomane mina yegl di prukwa, Na wana Solomon Yawe yugu kei tenabuka i, wakai yene ka kaimane kenabuka paugwa. Yoba dumo pere pere kipai meglkwa i, ede u yugu i wakai kandre, yugu wakai siragl mere yenabere i yoba mudu di tenaiglkwa paugwa. Yegl pamiba na wana yagl kulu moglsre, ye siragl mere Yawe yugu kei tenabuka i pre kan pogl sikrukwa. Yegl pre na ye yugu kenabedi taragl tau ake kun eragle di, yegl di prukwa. Ye yegl di prisre, kor mogl pai moglkwa igne taragl tau mere ake kun erukwa.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Ana okuo Devit ye wam Solomon agle dugo, ugwa. Ye ugo, Devit ye wam yugu kei, Yawe, Israel yoba Godno moglkwa i, kei tenabedi di togwa.<verse eid="1CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">*************************</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />Ana Devit ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Wana yo, Yawe ene motnara mogl tenabiwa. Mogl tenan, Yawe, Godnen moglkwa i, ene di tomere ene ye yugumo kei tenantga kogon i, u wakai enabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="1CH 22:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Devit goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Ana Devit, Jesi wam moglkwa i, ye Israel yoba mudu kingno moglkwa. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Ye bugla yugu 7-pela dumo Hebron we dimara i mogl, Israel yoba suglno moglsre, te, bugla yugu 33 dumo Jerusalem mogl, Israel yoba ama suglno moglkwa. Yegl pre ye Israel yoba kingno moglkwa i, bugla yugu i swara ede bugla yugu 40-pela ye kingno moglkwa. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Ye bugla yugu 40-pela Israel yoba kingno moglsre, kidagl kaima yedre, goglkwa. Ye kor moglkwa igne, ye mige ya ki mere kide kan yogo, yoba ye debie sigwa. Ana Devit goglko, ye wam Solomon ye agaimo idre, Israel yoba kingno moglkwa.<verse eid="1CH 29:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>